OL,3,GNEWSAChild abuse accusations
OL,4,A'disgusting', Snooker champion Dott
OL,5,Atells trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FSnooker player Graeme Dott has said
OL,8,Fallegations that he abused a boy and a
OL,9,Fgirl are "disgusting", during a trial
OL,10,Fat the High Court in Glasgow.
OL,12,FThe former world champion denied "ever
OL,13,Facting inappropriately with anyone" as
OL,14,Fhe appeared in the dock over charges
OL,15,Ffrom1993 and 2010.
OL,17,FThe court heard claims that Dott, 49,
OL,18,Fmolested the boy in a shower then later
OL,19,F"rewarded" him with money, crisps and
OL,20,Ffizzy drinks.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
