OL,3,GNEWSAChild abuse accusations
OL,4,A'disgusting', Snooker champion Dott
OL,5,Atells trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis alleged victim, now a man in his
OL,8,F20s, said abuse began when he was eight
OL,9,Fyears old, shortly after Dott won the
OL,10,Fworld title at The Crucible in 2006.
